docs/dialogues/

# Generated data under work/ — most contain PII (Jira exports, emails,
# calendar entries, Google Doc content) or are large/transient. The
# per-directory rules guarantee no file slips through regardless of extension;
# the catch-all covers ad-hoc generated files. Review carefully and use
# `git add -f` for intentional exceptions.
work/sprint-notes/*/calendar/
work/sprint-notes/*/claude-code/history-excerpt.jsonl
work/sprint-notes/*/email/
work/sprint-notes/*/git/
work/sprint-notes/*/github/
work/sprint-notes/*/google-docs/
work/sprint-notes/*/jira/
work/sprint-notes/*/prior-sprint/
work/progress-briefs/*/jira-issues/
work/**/*.html
work/**/*.json
work/**/*.md
work/**/*.pdf
work/**/*.yaml
!work/sprint-notes/README.md

# One-off data files
events-mentioning-ai.json
